OL,3,GNEWSAArson-sniffing fire dogs win
OL,4,Anational award
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo fire investigation dogs and their
OL,7,Fhandlers whose work has helped secure
OL,8,F580 years' worth of custodial sentences
OL,9,Fhave been recognised with a national
OL,10,Faward.
OL,12,FDogs Ginny and Barney and handlers Dave
OL,13,FCoss and Tim Marston work with police
OL,14,Fand fire services in Nottinghamshire,
OL,15,FDerbyshire, Leicestershire and
OL,16,FLincolnshire to help determine how and
OL,17,Fwhere a fire started.
OL,19,FNottinghamshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,20,F(NFRS) said their work helped solve
OL,21,Fsome of the most complex
OL,22,Finvestigations.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
