OL,3,GNEWSAArson-sniffing fire dogs win
OL,4,Anational award
OL,5,
OL,6,FBeth Pearson, fire investigation
OL,7,Fmanager at NFRS, said: "This medal is a
OL,8,Ffitting recognition of the remarkable
OL,9,Fwork the dogs do in helping bring
OL,10,Farsonists to justice, alongside the
OL,11,Fdedication of their handlers."
